    "title": "SUPERSTAR JYPNATION",
    "description": "J.Y.Park, 2PM, DAY6, TWICE, ITZY, Stray Kids, Xdinary Heroes, NMIXX, NiziU, NEXZ !\r\nPlay the JYPNATION artist song in my hand with SUPERSTAR!\r\n\r\nNew songs and new card themes of JYPNATION artists updated every week\r\n -The song you want is here! You can see the songs sung by JYP Nation artists\r\n -If you collect cards, you can collect rewards! Collect a theme card that is updated every week!\r\n\r\nPlay with fans from all over the world in the weekly league and world records\r\n -An a high score in the weekly league and challenge higher tiers\r\n -The first place is mine! World Records competing with users around the world\r\n\r\nHow to meet the exclusive content of SUPERSTAR JYPNATION?\r\n -Meet my favorite love with a live theme!\r\n -On, now, you can check the exclusive content of JYP Nation artists released only in SUPERSTARs!\r\n -I feel like playing with the artist! Artist Pack Launch! Check out the combination of honey that combines music and voice now!\r\n \r\n ---------------------\r\n\r\n[Guide to access rights to smartphone apps]\r\nWhen using the app, we are requesting access to the following services.\r\n \r\n[Required approach permission]\r\n-Photo/Video/File: To save game data in storage\r\n-Reading external repository, recording: Necessary to store various settings in the game and to store music data cache\r\n-Call: Necessary to analyze advertising tracking and create PUSH reception tokens\r\n-Wi-Fi connection information: When downloading additional data, it is necessary to check the Wi-Fi connection and send a guide message.\r\n-ID: Necessary for 'Creating and Confirmation of User Revision'\r\n\r\n[Selection approach permission]\r\n-Note: To receive information notifications and advertising PUSH notifications sent from the game app.\r\n* You can use the app without agreeing with the optional access rights.\r\n* It may be difficult to use some of the functions of the service when the optional approach.\r\n\r\n[How to withdraw access to access]\r\nSettings> Select the app and withdraw\r\n\r\n\u203b If the notes do not come down smoothly when playing the game, please check the \"Low \" in the [Display Settings] option of [Settings]!\r\n\u203b SUPERSTAR JYPNATION  can be enjoyed for free, but the fee is charged when purchasing some paid items.\r\n\u203b For other inquiries, please send it to support.jypnation@dalcomsoft.com and we will do our best to consult.\r\n ---------------------\r\nSUPERSTAR JYPNATION Sweet Soft Game Inquiry\r\nsupport.jypnation@dalcomsoft.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "J.Y.Park, 2PM, DAY6, TWICE, ITZY, Stray Kids, Xdinary Heroes, NMIXX, NiziU, NEXZ !<br>Play the JYPNATION artist song in my hand with SUPERSTAR!<br><br>New songs and new card themes of JYPNATION artists updated every week<br> -The song you want is here! You can see the songs sung by JYP Nation artists<br> -If you collect cards, you can collect rewards! Collect a theme card that is updated every week!<br><br>Play with fans from all over the world in the weekly league and world records<br> -An a high score in the weekly league and challenge higher tiers<br> -The first place is mine! World Records competing with users around the world<br><br>How to meet the exclusive content of SUPERSTAR JYPNATION?<br> -Meet my favorite love with a live theme!<br> -On, now, you can check the exclusive content of JYP Nation artists released only in SUPERSTARs!<br> -I feel like playing with the artist! Artist Pack Launch! Check out the combination of honey that combines music and voice now!<br> <br> ---------------------<br><br>[Guide to access rights to smartphone apps]<br>When using the app, we are requesting access to the following services.<br> <br>[Required approach permission]<br>-Photo/Video/File: To save game data in storage<br>-Reading external repository, recording: Necessary to store various settings in the game and to store music data cache<br>-Call: Necessary to analyze advertising tracking and create PUSH reception tokens<br>-Wi-Fi connection information: When downloading additional data, it is necessary to check the Wi-Fi connection and send a guide message.<br>-ID: Necessary for &#39;Creating and Confirmation of User Revision&#39;<br><br>[Selection approach permission]<br>-Note: To receive information notifications and advertising PUSH notifications sent from the game app.<br>* You can use the app without agreeing with the optional access rights.<br>* It may be difficult to use some of the functions of the service when the optional approach.<br><br>[How to withdraw access to access]<br>Settings&gt; Select the app and withdraw<br><br>\u203b If the notes do not come down smoothly when playing the game, please check the &quot;Low &quot; in the [Display Settings] option of [Settings]!<br>\u203b SUPERSTAR JYPNATION  can be enjoyed for free, but the fee is charged when purchasing some paid items.<br>\u203b For other inquiries, please send it to support.jypnation@dalcomsoft.com and we will do our best to consult.<br> ---------------------<br>SUPERSTAR JYPNATION Sweet Soft Game Inquiry<br>support.jypnation@dalcomsoft.com",
